{
 "_readme": [
  "Voice id → where it plays in the v2 slice (written by chronicle/tools/story_voice.js; do not edit by hand).",
  "story / optional: add `voice: '<id>'` to the options of the ev.say / E.say that shows `text` (file, event, key; `line` = where the text was on 2026-09-27).",
  "  For a say with a list of pages, pass `voice: [id1, id2]` (one id per page). For a line inside a list such as P2 in prologue_roa.js, pass the id of that entry to its E.say.",
  "  optional = the design says \"no voice\" there (opening captions: ev.caption has no voice option yet — it needs `{voice}` support in UIK caption, or R.Audio.playVoice(id) before the caption; windhill: STORY_BIBLE says no voice).",
  "bark: a 1–2 s greeting played when the player opens the talk: R.Audio.playVoice(id) at the start of the talk event (or a `bark` field on the map NPC read by the field talk code). Suggested: only the first talk per visit to a map, never over a voiced line.",
  "Text rule: the voiced text must stay exactly as it is; if the polish pass changes one of these texts, drop the voice from that say (node chronicle/tools/story_voice.js --check lists them)."
 ],
 "lines": {
  "v_otto_pharos_01": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto",
   "key": "first meeting (before party) say 1",
   "line": 106,
   "text": "わしは灯台守のオットー。\n灯台の火が消えてしまって、\nゆうべは眠れんかった。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_pharos_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_pharos_02": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto",
   "key": "first meeting (before party) say 2",
   "line": 107,
   "text": "……なに、灯台へ行くと？\nひとりで？ とんでもない。\n酒場「潮風亭」で仲間を見つけておいで。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_pharos_02.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_pharos_03": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto",
   "key": "with party say 1",
   "line": 111,
   "text": "おお、仲間を連れてきたか。\nそれなら話は別じゃ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_pharos_03.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_pharos_04": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto",
   "key": "with party say 2",
   "line": 112,
   "text": "灯台の守り歌が、\nどうしても思い出せんのじゃ。\nあの歌がなけりゃ、火はつかん。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_pharos_04.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_pharos_05": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto",
   "key": "with party say 3",
   "line": 113,
   "text": "……頼む。\nこれが灯台の鍵じゃ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_pharos_05.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_pharos_06": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto",
   "key": "after the key say 1",
   "line": 116,
   "text": "灯台は、町を出て南の\n岬の先じゃ。行く前に、\n戦いの心得を教えておこう。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_pharos_06.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_tower_01": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_lighthouse.js",
   "event": "lighthouse_1_tutorial",
   "key": "say 1",
   "line": 29,
   "text": "中から、ネズミの鳴き声が……\n気をつけるんじゃ！",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_tower_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_tower_02": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_lighthouse.js",
   "event": "lighthouse_1_tutorial",
   "key": "after a lost tutorial battle",
   "line": 37,
   "text": "……危なかったのう。\nひと息ついて、もう一度じゃ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_tower_02.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_tower_03": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_lighthouse.js",
   "event": "lighthouse_1_tutorial",
   "key": "glimmer explained (technique; spell=false)",
   "line": 41,
   "text": "今のは……『閃き』じゃな。\n戦いの中で、ふいに\n新しい技を思いつくことがある。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_tower_03.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_tower_04": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_lighthouse.js",
   "event": "lighthouse_1_tutorial",
   "key": "glimmer explained (spell; spell=true)",
   "line": 41,
   "text": "今のは……『閃き』じゃな。\n戦いの中で、ふいに\n新しい術を思いつくことがある。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_tower_04.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_tower_05": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_lighthouse.js",
   "event": "lighthouse_1_tutorial",
   "key": "last say before leaving",
   "line": 43,
   "text": "わしは港へ戻っておる。\n上の灯室を、頼んだぞ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_tower_05.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_reward_01": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto_reward",
   "key": "first time say 2 (the song)",
   "line": 132,
   "text": "♪　海の果てまで、灯よ届け\n帰る舟に、道を照らせ……。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_reward_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_reward_02": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto_reward",
   "key": "first time say 3",
   "line": 133,
   "text": "これは、わしが若いころから\n使ってきたランタンじゃ。\n持っていっておくれ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_reward_02.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_reward_03": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto_reward",
   "key": "first time say 4",
   "line": 136,
   "text": "若いころ、灯台には\n『朝番』というのがあってな。\n火が戻ったら、また立てるつもりじゃ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_reward_03.ogg"
  },
  "v_otto_reward_04": {
   "speaker": "otto",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_otto_reward",
   "key": "first time say 5",
   "line": 137,
   "text": "……はて。何を見張る番\nじゃったかのう。\nどうしても思い出せん。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_otto_reward_04.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_01": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[0]",
   "line": 49,
   "text": "そうそう、大事な話があるんだ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_02": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[1]",
   "line": 50,
   "text": "近ごろ、あちこちで\n伝承が消えていくんだよ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_02.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_03": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[2]",
   "line": 51,
   "text": "歌の続きが出てこない。\n祭りの由来が分からない。\nそんな話ばかりさ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_03.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_04": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[3]",
   "line": 52,
   "text": "わたしたち語り部は、それを\n『白紙』と呼んでいる。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_04.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_05": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[4]",
   "line": 53,
   "text": "里の語り石の文字も、\n半分が白く抜けてしまった。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_05.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_06": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[5]",
   "line": 54,
   "text": "それにね、港町ファロスの\n灯台の火が、細りはじめて三晩。\nきのう、とうとう消えたそうだ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_06.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_07": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[6]",
   "line": 55,
   "text": "あの灯台には、守り歌という\n古い伝承があってね。\nそれも、白紙になりかけている。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_07.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_08": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[8]",
   "line": 57,
   "text": "ただし、ひとりで行っちゃ\nだめだよ。ファロスの酒場\n「潮風亭」で、仲間を探しなさい。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_08.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_p2_09": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "P2[9]",
   "line": 58,
   "text": "それから、これを持って\nお行き。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_p2_09.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_seat_01": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_seat",
   "key": "say (berna_desk)",
   "line": 120,
   "text": "昔からの習わしさ。\n誰の席かは……忘れちまったよ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_seat_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_depart_01": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_departure",
   "key": "say after the chapter caption (rumours)",
   "line": 174,
   "text": "うわさは酒場に集まるものさ。\nまずは港の酒場で\n聞いてごらん。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_depart_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_depart_02": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_departure",
   "key": "farewell (the first forgetting)",
   "line": 180,
   "text": "わたしは里へ帰るよ。\n……いってらっしゃい、",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_depart_02.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_home_01": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "after prologue pick (default)",
   "line": 79,
   "text": "おかえり。年代記は、\nちゃんと書いているかい？",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_home_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_home_02": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "after prologue pick cleared_r_forest",
   "line": 78,
   "text": "森の灯が戻ったそうだね。\n語り石の文字が、ほんの少し\n読めるようになった気がするよ。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_home_02.ogg"
  },
  "v_berna_home_03": {
   "speaker": "berna",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/prologue_roa.js",
   "event": "roa_berna",
   "key": "stay morning (E.stay o.morning)",
   "line": 82,
   "text": "よく眠れたかい？\n……さあ、いってらっしゃい。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_berna_home_03.ogg"
  },
  "v_fine_forest_02": {
   "speaker": "fine",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/forest_elder.js",
   "event": "elder_fine",
   "key": "say 2 (after v_fine_forest_01)",
