   "audio": "assets/voice/v_fine_opening_03.ogg"
  },
  "v_rowell_pharos_01": {
   "speaker": "rowell",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_rowell",
   "key": "repeat talk pick prologue_done",
   "line": 42,
   "text": "灯台に火が戻っただと？\n……写し取ったはずの歌が、\nどうして。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_rowell_pharos_01.ogg"
  },
  "v_rowell_pharos_02": {
   "speaker": "rowell",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_rowell",
   "key": "repeat talk pick prologue_key",
   "line": 43,
   "text": "灯台守から鍵を借りたそうだな。\n……火をともせるものなら、\nともしてみるがいい。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_rowell_pharos_02.ogg"
  },
  "v_rowell_pharos_03": {
   "speaker": "rowell",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/pharos_story.js",
   "event": "pharos_rowell",
   "key": "repeat talk pick default",
   "line": 44,
   "text": "まだいたのか。\n写し取った伝承は、本院で\n大切に保管される。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_rowell_pharos_03.ogg"
  },
  "v_elm_forest_07": {
   "speaker": "elm",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/forest_elder.js",
   "event": "elder_elm",
   "key": "say array page 1",
   "line": 151,
   "text": "森の道は、もう閉ざさぬ。\n夏至の歌も、村の者たちが\nまた歌ってくれるだろう。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_elm_forest_07.ogg"
  },
  "v_elm_forest_08": {
   "speaker": "elm",
   "kind": "story",
   "file": "v2/src/events/forest_elder.js",
   "event": "elder_elm",
   "key": "say array page 2",
   "line": 151,
   "text": "ただ、迷いの森の魔物は、\nわたしにも鎮められぬ。\n腕を磨くには、よいだろう。",
   "audio": "assets/voice/v_elm_forest_08.ogg"
  },
